# PART D – REUSABLE "FIX" PROMPTS

**When a phase has errors:**
```
The previous phase has this error: <paste exact error/log>. Find the root cause, fix only what is necessary, do not change the API contract, re-run the tests for that phase and show the real output.
```

**When you need to change the API (rare):**
```
I need to change endpoint <X>: <what and why>. First show me exactly what changes in the contract, backend files and frontend service calls. Do not implement until I confirm. After confirmation update 00_SHARED_API_CONTRACT.md / docs/API_CONTRACT.md as well.
```

**Before handing over to the frontend developer:**
```
Verify the running backend against docs/API_CONTRACT.md by calling every endpoint and list any difference in path, field name, status code or response shape. Fix differences in the backend (not the contract) unless the contract is clearly wrong.
```